---
title: "EyeWire II — Data Flow Diagram"
---
sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Browser as Vue 3 SPA
    participant NG as Neuroglancer<br/>(WebGL Viewer)
    participant MiddleAuth as Middleauth<br/>OAuth Proxy
    participant CAVE as CAVE API<br/>(Annotation Server)
    participant Supabase as Supabase<br/>(PostgreSQL + Realtime)
    participant GSheets as Google Sheets<br/>API v4

    Note over User,GSheets: === Authentication Flow ===

    User->>Browser: Open EyeWire II
    Browser->>NG: Initialize neuroglancer container
    NG->>MiddleAuth: Detect auth requirement<br/>(from graphene:// layer URL)
    MiddleAuth->>User: Redirect to OAuth login
    User->>MiddleAuth: Authenticate
    MiddleAuth->>Browser: Bearer token
    Browser->>Browser: Store token in localStorage<br/>(auth_token_v2_{serverUrl})

    Note over User,GSheets: === Segment Selection & Annotation ===

    User->>NG: Select neuron segment in 3D view
    NG->>Browser: MutationObserver detects<br/>new segment in DOM
    Browser->>Browser: button_service.ts injects<br/>custom UI buttons
    Browser->>CAVE: GET /annotation/api/v1/table/<br/>cell_status_dev/annotation/<br/>?filter_equal=pt_root_id:{id}
    CAVE-->>Browser: Annotation data (status, type)
    Browser->>Browser: useSegmentAnnotationStore<br/>updates panel state
    Browser->>User: Show AnnotationPanel<br/>(completion status, cell type)

    Note over User,GSheets: === Mark Cell Complete ===

    User->>Browser: Click "Mark Complete"
    Browser->>CAVE: POST /annotation/api/v1/table/<br/>cell_status_dev/annotation/<br/>{ type: "BoundText", tag: "complete",<br/>  pt_root_id, pt: {position} }
    CAVE-->>Browser: 200 OK (annotation ID)
    Browser->>Supabase: INSERT into edit_log<br/>(operation: "mark_complete")
    Browser->>Supabase: UPDATE users SET<br/>cells_completed += 1
    Supabase-->>Browser: Realtime broadcast<br/>on activity_feed channel
    Browser->>User: Show celebration animation<br/>+ AchievementToast (if badge earned)

    Note over User,GSheets: === Merge / Split Operations ===

    User->>NG: Press M (merge) or C (multicut)
    NG->>CAVE: Graphene merge/split API call<br/>(via graphene provider)
    CAVE-->>NG: Updated segment graph
    NG->>Browser: Segment ID changed
    Browser->>Supabase: INSERT into edit_log<br/>(operation: "merge" | "split")
    Browser->>Supabase: UPDATE users SET<br/>total_merges/total_splits += 1
    Browser->>Browser: useUserStatsStore recalculates<br/>daily/weekly/monthly stats

    Note over User,GSheets: === Proofreading Quest Queue ===

    User->>Browser: Open Quest Board
    Browser->>Supabase: SELECT * FROM proofreading_tasks<br/>WHERE status = 'pending'
    Supabase-->>Browser: Available tasks
    User->>Browser: Claim a task
    Browser->>Supabase: INSERT into task_assignments<br/>(status: 'active', expires_at: +30min)
    Browser->>Supabase: UPDATE proofreading_tasks<br/>SET status = 'assigned'
    Supabase-->>Browser: Realtime: task claimed

    Note over User,GSheets: === Cell Library (Google Sheets) ===

    User->>Browser: Open Cell Library panel
    Browser->>GSheets: GET spreadsheet CSV export<br/>(via published sheet URL)
    GSheets-->>Browser: CSV data (segment IDs,<br/>coordinates, cell types)
    Browser->>Browser: useProofreadingQueueStore<br/>parses CSV into task items
    User->>Browser: Select cell from library
    Browser->>NG: Navigate to coordinates<br/>& load segment

    Note over User,GSheets: === Help Requests (Second Opinion) ===

    User->>Browser: Request second opinion
    Browser->>Supabase: INSERT into help_requests<br/>(segment_id, position, issue_type)
    Supabase-->>Browser: Realtime broadcast
    Browser->>User: Other users see<br/>pending help requests

    Note over User,GSheets: === Realtime Activity Feed ===

    Supabase->>Browser: Realtime subscription<br/>on activity_feed table
    Browser->>User: Live feed of community<br/>edits, completions, achievements

    Note over User,GSheets: === Leaderboard & Stats ===

    User->>Browser: Open Leaderboard
    Browser->>Supabase: SELECT * FROM users<br/>ORDER BY total_edits DESC
    Supabase-->>Browser: Ranked user list
    Browser->>User: Display All Time /<br/>Month / Week rankings
